NB␀␀␀P@B␀␀␀`@B␀␀␀ @B␀␀␀pÓ@␀␀␀pÓ@␀␀␀ 6MB␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀pFD␀␀␀PEMB␀␀␀ÀNB␀␀␀àFMB␀␀␀°&B␀␀␀à&B␀␀␀&B␀␀␀ )B␀␀␀@&B␀␀␀t+B␀␀␀P&B␀␀␀`&B␀␀␀p&B␀␀␀€&B␀␀␀À&B␀␀␀Ğ&B␀␀␀&B␀␀␀0&B␀␀␀␀GMB␀␀␀@jNB␀␀␀P&B␀␀␀`&B␀␀␀€&B␀␀␀°&B␀␀␀PGMB␀␀␀`HMB␀␀␀ĞIMB␀␀␀°@␀␀␀Ğ7MB␀␀␀0ŒÌD␀␀␀ FD␀␀␀ÀoBD␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀˜@HD␀␀␀PğNB␀␀␀`b␀@␀␀␀`b␀@␀␀␀¨QB␀␀␀pb␀@␀␀␀Ğb␀@␀␀␀`b␀@␀␀␀Àc␀@␀␀␀`NB␀␀␀€š@␀␀␀€b␀@␀␀␀PíNB␀␀␀7MB␀␀␀p‚ïB␀␀␀ğ„ïB␀␀␀ĞóîB␀␀␀@şõB␀␀␀`òB␀␀␀°	NB␀␀␀@€NB␀␀␀P¸MB␀␀␀°êRB␀␀␀
#define MODE_SEPARATE_SPECULAR
␀
#define MOTION_VECTORS
